sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant O as OTP Service
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant N as Notification
    C->>P: Chọn invoice và account
    P->>D: Validate; create payment + transaction
    P->>O: Generate OTP BILL_PAYMENT
    O-->>C: OTP
    C->>P: Verify OTP
    P->>D: BEGIN; lock account + invoice
    P->>D: Debit; ledger; mark PAID/SUCCESS; COMMIT
    P->>N: Thông báo kết quả
    P-->>C: Payment SUCCESS
